                    <h2 class="heading-m text-dark-1">A future-forward home that flows in your rhythm</h2>
                    <p class="text-m text-dark-1 paragraph-spacing-10">Volta SKAI is designed so that life flows effortlessly – in your rhythm. Intelligent access systems allow for keyless entry throughout the building, including summoning elevators and unlocking doors remotely, with quiet precision. Spacious lifts offer direct access between your home, the parking garage, and the lobbies, ensuring quick and seamless movement. Upon arrival, a double-height design lobby offers a striking first impression and a calm, refined threshold between the bustling city life and privacy of home. For those arriving by car, a multi-level parking facility adds both comfort and convenience to the everyday journey.</p>
