                            <p class="text-m text-dark-1 paragraph-spacing-10">From Volta SKAI residences, uninterrupted vistas stretch across the sea and marina, the historic silhouette of Tallinn’s Old Town, and the expanse of Kalamaja Park and Paljassaare greenery — soon joined by the Volta Park. Light is not merely welcomed but choreographed. Soaring ceiling heights, full-height glazing, and spatial compositions designed with intent ensure each home feels open, radiant, and intimately connected to the horizon. Situated at the highest point of Tallinn’s coveted Golden Mile, Volta SKAI offers a perspective that is not only elevated—but enduring.</p>
